  "prefLabel": "Jus 602.17 Fee for Service Medicaid Rule",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 602.17 “Fee for Service Medicaid Rule” means the rate used to determine reimbursement for compensation under the program based on the applicable fee-for-service rate as determined by the department of health and human services under its Medicaid managed care program.\n\nSource. #12938, eff 12-9-19",
